        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset CSL-SQT, Casey Square Rose Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Casey Square Rose Leverset is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. Choose from dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. The Modern Casey Square Rose Lever is available in satin nickel, iron black, and polished chrome finishes. \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Casey Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA Grade 3</li>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>SmartKey Anti-pick system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed lever.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Meets UL 3 hour fire rating for 409, 412, 413, 420, 430 Optional UL 1/3 hour fire rating for all functions.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Kwikset Casey Lever with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore 2 1/8\". Edge Bore 1\".</li>\r\n<li>Bolt: 1/2\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1\" x 2 1/4\" full lip.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive lever for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational lever is for one side of the door. Visible installation screws on this function. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock on both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Casey Lever with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Casey Square Rose Leverset is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. Choose from dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. The Modern Casey Square Rose Lever is available in satin nickel, iron black, and polished chrome finishes.",
